---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Giant Caulk"
  description="Three decades of commercial caulking, sealing, and leak detection. Based in the Greater Indianapolis area and willing to travel."
  navTheme="dark"
  footerTheme="dark"
>
  <section class="px-4 md:px-8 pt-6 pb-16 max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">

    {/* Page title */}
    <h1 class="font-display text-6xl md:text-8xl text-navy tracking-widest text-center mb-12 md:mb-16">
      ABOUT US
    </h1>

    {/* Two-column grid — photo + paragraph in each column. */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-14">

      <article class="flex flex-col">
        <div class="rounded-sm overflow-hidden shadow-lg shadow-navy/10 aspect-[4/3]">
          <picture>
            <source media="(min-width: 700px)" srcset="/images/about-1.jpg" />
            <img
              src="/images/about-1-mobile.jpg"
              alt="A clean sealant joint between a stone façade and a metal door frame on a commercial building."
              class="h-full w-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </picture>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-6 md:mt-8 font-body text-base md:text-lg text-navy leading-relaxed text-center md:text-left">
          At Giant Caulk, we bring more than 30 years of experience to
          commercial caulking, sealing, leak detection, and building protection.
          Based in the Greater Indianapolis area, we proudly serve Indianapolis
          and surrounding communities &mdash; and we&rsquo;re willing to travel
          wherever the job takes us.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 font-body text-base md:text-lg text-navy leading-relaxed text-center md:text-left">
          Our services include commercial caulking and sealants, leak detection
          and prevention, expansion joints, and window sealing. Whether you&rsquo;re
          dealing with an active leak, deteriorating sealant, or looking to
          prevent future water intrusion, our goal is to identify the problem
          and provide a dependable, long-lasting solution.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="flex flex-col">
        <div class="rounded-sm overflow-hidden shadow-lg shadow-navy/10 aspect-[4/3]">
          <picture>
            <source media="(min-width: 700px)" srcset="/images/about-2.jpg" />
            <img
              src="/images/about-2-mobile.jpg"
              alt="Before and after: cracked, failing sealant on the left, clean new sealant on the right."
              class="h-full w-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </picture>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-6 md:mt-8 font-body text-base md:text-lg text-navy leading-relaxed text-center md:text-left">
          Quality service is at the center of everything we do. We believe our
          job is about more than completing a project; it&rsquo;s about earning
          our customers&rsquo; trust.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 font-body text-base md:text-lg text-navy leading-relaxed text-center md:text-left">
          We strive to build and maintain lasting relationships by providing
          reliable workmanship, clear communication, and solutions tailored to
          each property. Whether it&rsquo;s leak detection or leak prevention,
          we&rsquo;ll work with you to solve the issue and help protect your
          building from the elements.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 font-body text-base md:text-lg text-navy leading-relaxed text-center md:text-left">
          With decades of hands-on experience and a commitment to doing the job
          right, Giant Caulk is ready to help with your next commercial caulking
          or sealing project.
        </p>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
